 B - 待审)</span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-500 truncate max-w-[240px]\">CMP06_B.docx</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      \n          <div id=\"sec-1\" class=\"clause-card bg-white border border-[#E2E8F0] rounded-lg overflow-hidden transition\" data-status=\"unchanged\" data-risk=\"none\">\n            <div class=\"bg-[#F8FAFC] px-3.5 py-2.5 border-b border-[#E2E8F0] flex items-center justify-between text-xs cursor-pointer select-none hover:bg-slate-100/60 transition\" onclick=\"toggleClause('sec-1')\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n                <span id=\"chevron-sec-1\" class=\"text-slate-400 inline-block transform transition-transform duration-200\" style=\"transform: rotate(-90deg);\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 inline-block shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5\"/>\n  </svg></span>\n                <span class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-[#243041] tracking-tight\">前言 合同引言与主体信息</span>\n                <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 text-slate-400 border border-slate-200 rounded text-xs\">无变更</span>\n                \n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3\">\n                <span class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs font-normal\" title=\"基于字符编辑距离计算\">相似度: 100.0%</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-[#315A7D] font-medium hover:underline\">折叠/展开</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"content-sec-1\" class=\"clause-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\n              \n              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 p-3.5 text-[#243041] bg-white\">\n                \n            <div class=\"content-formatted pr-3 border-r border-[#E2E8F0] break-words leading-relaxed text-[15px] text-[#243041]\"><div class=\"clause-hierarchical-line\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.25rem; line-height: 1.7;\">设备采购合作合同</div><div class=\"clause-hierarchical-line\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.25rem; line-height: 1.7;\">甲方 星桥测试有限公司    乙方 青空テスト株式会社</div></div>\n            <div class=\"content-raw hidden pr-3 border-r border-[#E2E8F0] break-words font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#243041]\">设备采购合作合同<br>甲方 星桥测试有限公司    乙方 青空テスト株式会社</div>\n          \n                \n            <div class=\"content-formatted pl-3 break-words leading-relaxed text-[15px] text-[#243041]\"><div class=\"clause-hierarchical-line\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.25rem; line-height: 1.7;\">设备采购合作合同</div><div class=\"clause-hierarchical-line\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.25rem; line-height: 1.7;\">甲方 星桥测试有限公司    乙方 青空テスト株式会社</div></div>\n            <div class=\"content-raw hidden pl-3 break-words font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#243041]\">设备采购合作合同<br>甲方 星桥测试有限公司    乙方 青空テスト株式会社</div>\n          \n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n\n          <div id=\"sec-2\" class=\"clause-card bg-white border border-[#E2E8F0] rounded-lg overflow-hidden transition\" data-status=\"unchanged\" data-risk=\"none\">\n            <div class=\"bg-[#F8FAFC] px-3.5 py-2.5 border-b border-[#E2E8F0] flex items-center justify-between text-xs cursor-pointer select-none hover:bg-slate-100/60 transition\" onclick=\"toggleClause('sec-2')\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n                <span id=\"chevron-sec-2\" class=\"text-slate-400 inline-block transform transition-transform duration-200\" style=\"transform: rotate(-90deg);\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 inline-block shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5\"/>\n  </svg></span>\n                <span class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-[#243041] tracking-tight\">第11条